---
// src/components/Footer.astro
// Flybit Network Observatory Footer
import { siteConfig } from '../config/site';
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container footer-inner">
    <!-- Quick Nav Links in Footer -->
    <div class="footer-nav">
      <a href="/">首页</a>
      <a href="/jichang">机场推荐</a>
      <a href="/vpn">VPN加速</a>
      <a href="/tizi">梯子推荐</a>
      <a href="/clash">Clash专题</a>
      <a href="/nodes">节点线路</a>
      <a href="/tutorial">使用教程</a>
      <a href="/free">免费试用</a>
      <a href="/brands">机场品牌库</a>
      <a href="/radar">避坑雷达</a>
      <a href="/faq">疑难FAQ</a>
      <a href="/speedtest">实测大盘</a>
      <a href="/clients">客户端大全</a>
      <a href="/blog">专题指南</a>
      <a href="/about">评测准则</a>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-copy">
      <span>© {currentYear} {siteConfig.title} (<a href="https://flybit.fun">flybit.fun</a>).</span>
      <span class="footer-separator">•</span>
      <span class="footer-ssg">Pure SSG 极速架构驱动</span>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-signature">
      <em>中立实测、晚高峰抗压监控与真实流媒体/AI 解锁审计。告别虚假云测评，用数据说话。</em>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-disclosure">
      <small>🛡️ 广告透明度披露：本站部分外链包含 Affiliate 推广代码（已规范采用 rel="nofollow sponsored noopener" 协议）。通过推荐链接注册可能为实验室带来微薄维护佣金，不增加用户支付费用。本站评测结论基于真实网络测试建立，保持客观独立。</small>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 2.5rem 0 3rem;
    margin-top: auto;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    background: var(--bg-surface);
  }

  .footer-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 1.15rem;
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1rem;
  }

  .footer-nav {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .footer-nav a {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .footer-nav a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .footer-copy {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .footer-copy a {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .footer-separator {
    opacity: 0.4;
  }

  .footer-signature {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .footer-disclosure {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    opacity: 0.75;
    max-width: 720px;
  }
</style>
